    "body": "I think this also applies to \"switching\" and maybe some other things we sometimes inline.\r\n\r\nIf it makes it harder to read for folks I'm not opposed to inline less. And generally we probably should as we also try to put more in the algorithm header such as types and often return types (although return types don't apply to in parallel of course).",
