    "created_at": "2025-04-08T10:36:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-08T10:36:19Z",
    "body": "For the most part, if the steps are truly parallel then they shouldn't be numbered as there's no guarentee as to which of them will be evaluated \"first\". So such paralel blocks would be more akin to an unordered list (`<ul>`):\n\n1. Perform these things in parallel:\n    - ...\n    - ...\n    - ...\n2. When all are complete, move on to...\n\nThat being said, there can be utility to numbering things so they're easier to refer to.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
